      "role": "user",
      "content": "Sounds good, but they're gonna dig deeper than just \"the breadth of coverage.\" They're going to want specifics on the stability of our core data processing patent. If they ask if there are any ongoing legal challenges or risks to that specific patent's validity, what's the move? I don't want them getting spooked and tanking the valuation.",
